Phase 2 item 2 — token budget + hot-path compaction + per-model settings
==========================================================================
Node: M2.7 (Basic Prompt Compiler and one-agent runtime)
Defect: Future-tasks.md section 2 item 2 (audit 2026-09-06)
Revision: commit 5856de3 (branch phase2/loop-hardening)
Environment: macOS darwin 25.5.0 arm64, local dev profile, UTC timestamps

WHAT CHANGED
------------
The conversation grew unbounded (crates/compaction never linked);
max_output_tokens was hard-coded 4096, temperature 0.2, no reasoning or
thinking controls. Now:

- crates/compaction/src/hot_path.rs — bounded synchronous compaction
  planner (docs/19 "hard pressure" path): stage 1 truncates the OLDEST
  tool-result payloads in place (call-id linkage always survives);
  stage 2 summarizes whole assistant+tool-result blocks (never index 0,
  never the recent block) into epoch lines via CompactionManifest;
  stage 3 last resort truncates the recent block's results. Per-item
  residual token accounting prevents double-counted savings (found by
  the extreme-budget unit test before shipping).
- Domain: CompactionApplied run event (epoch id, affected_messages,
  reclaimed_tokens, sha256 manifest_digest).
- one_agent.rs: budget check before EVERY invoke over the conversation
  estimate (MODBIT_MAX_INPUT_TOKENS, default 32768); the model-visible
  projection is compacted, canonical history untouched; EpochRegistry
  lineage extended per compaction; RunObserver.compaction_applied.
- providers: ModelRequest.reasoning_effort (envelope::ReasoningEffort);
  OpenAI body sends reasoning_effort; Anthropic body sends
  thinking.budget_tokens mapped from effort and clamped under
  max_tokens (dropped when it cannot fit — never sends a request the
  provider would reject). None sends nothing.
- providers/profiles.rs: per-model settings (reasoning-tier models get
  8192 output budget) + env overrides MODBIT_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS /
  MODBIT_TEMPERATURE / MODBIT_REASONING_EFFORT; scheduler wires them
  into AgentTask; EventStoreObserver persists CompactionApplied.

